    "content": "Recent attacks on shipping in the Strait of Hormuz have raised serious concerns regarding global oil supplies. These escalating tensions threaten market stability, leading to increased shipping insurance costs and renewed fears of energy disruptions worldwide. Analysts continue to monitor the situation closely as geopolitical risks impact vital maritime trade routes.",
